{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfbfa;--muted:#6b6b6b;--accent:#3a7ca5;--accent-2:#7ccfbe;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);--shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(20,30,40,0.08)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f1720;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f5f7f6)}
    header{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(58,124,165,0.06),rgba(124,207,190,0.03));backdrop-filter:saturate(1.1) blur(4px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,32,0.03)}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    nav{margin-left:auto}
    .navlinks{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    a.nav{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600}
    a.nav:hover{background:rgba(10,20,25,0.03);color:#0b3b4a}
    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}

    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:36px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}

    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px 0}

    /* Contact form */
    .form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(10,20,25,0.06);font-size:14px}
    button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:0;font-weight:700}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Progress mapper */
    .goals{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
    .goal{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fbfffd);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(10,20,25,0.03)}
    .pathmap{margin-top:14px;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(58,124,165,0.03),rgba(124,207,190,0.02));}
    .track{height:92px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;overflow:auto;padding-bottom:6px}
    .day{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#e6eef2;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;color:#0b3b4a}
    .day.active{background:var(--accent);color:white;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(58,124,165,0.18)}
    .milestone{margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:10px}
    .milestone div{background:var(--card);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(10,20,25,0.04);flex:1}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .testimonial{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .quote{font-style:italic;color:#073d47}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .badge{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f7fffb);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(10,20,25,0.04);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;cursor:default;position:relative}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:calc(100% + 10px);background:#082834;color:#dff6f1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;display:none}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{display:block}

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:22px auto;padding:22px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* small responsive */
    @media (max-width:980px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.brand{gap:12px}.logo{width:52px;height:52px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap" style="display:flex;align-items:center">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">W</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <div class="navlinks">
          <a class="nav" href="index.html">Home</a>
          <a class="nav" href="about.html">Story</a>
          <a class="nav" href="programs.html">Offerings</a>
          <a class="nav" href="services.html">Sessions</a>
          <a class="nav" href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
          <a class="nav" href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
          <a class="nav" href="book.html">Reserve</a>
          <a class="nav cta" href="contact.html">Connect</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="grid">
      <section class="panel">
        <h1>Let’s make the next 30 days feel manageable</h1>
        <p class="lead">Share what you want to steady first. I’ll sketch a clear path — daily moves you can actually keep — and we’ll use this to plan a short conversation.</p>

        <form class="form" id="contactForm">
          <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
          <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="Email" required />
          <input type="text" id="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" />

          <label class="muted">What matters most right now? (pick up to 3)</label>
          <div class="goals" id="goals">
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="sleep" /> Better sleep</label>
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="movement" /> Gentle movement</label>
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="calm" /> Less reactivity</label>
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="focus" /> Clearer focus</label>
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="nutrition" /> Simpler meals</label>
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="routine" /> Steady routines</label>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button type="button" class="primary" id="mapBtn">Map My 30 Days</button>
            <button type="submit" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(10,20,25,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px">Send message</button>
          </div>

          <div class="pathmap panel" id="pathmap" aria-live="polite" style="display:none">
            <div class="muted">30-day path</div>
            <div class="track" id="track" role="list" aria-label="30 day path"></div>
            <div class="milestone" id="milestones"></div>
          </div>

        </form>

        <div style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Prefer to chat? Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>. Or use the booking link below.</div>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="panel proof">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight:800">Proof & credentials</div>
              <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Real results, small steady changes</div>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:12px"><a href="testimonials.html">See more</a></div>
          </div>

          <div id="testimonial" class="testimonial" style="margin-top:12px">
            <div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7ccfbe,#3a7ca5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700">A</div>
            <div>
              <div class="quote" id="quote">"I started with tiny shifts and they changed my day-to-day fate."</div>
              <div class="muted" id="author" style="margin-top:6px">— Alex, working parent</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="badges" style="margin-top:10px">
            <div class="badge" data-tooltip="10+ years coaching experience">Coach tenure
              <div class="tooltip">10+ years coaching clients in daily practice</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Rated 4.9 by clients">High client satisfaction
              <div class="tooltip">Average 4.9 / 5 from client surveys</div>
            </div>
            <div class="badge" data-tooltip="Featured: mindful living press">Press mention
              <div class="tooltip">Featured in mindful-living press</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">or <a href="book.html">book a short call</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" style="margin-top:18px">
          <div style="font-weight:800">Office</div>
          <div class="muted">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px" class="muted">Availability varies week to week. Meetings are a mix of remote and short in-person sessions.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="muted">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — small, practical frameworks for steadier days. <span style="margin-left:8px">Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></span></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // small DOM helpers
    const el = id=>document.getElementById(id);
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Progress mapper
    const MAX_SELECTION = 3;
    const goalBoxes = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#goals input[type=checkbox]'));
    goalBoxes.forEach(cb=>cb.addEventListener('change', ()=>{
      const checked = goalBoxes.filter(g=>g.checked);
      if(checked.length > MAX_SELECTION){ cb.checked=false; }
    }));

    const mapBtn = el('mapBtn');
    mapBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const chosen = goalBoxes.filter(g=>g.checked).map(g=>g.value);
      if(chosen.length===0){ alert('Pick at least one focus to map your 30 days.'); return; }
      renderPathMap(chosen);
    });

    function renderPathMap(goals){
      const track = el('track'); track.innerHTML='';
      const container = el('pathmap'); container.style.display='block';

      // Simple scoring to color days: distribute focus across 30 days
      const colorFor = (i)=>{
        // assign each goal a hue and mix
        const base = {sleep:'#3a7ca5',movement:'#7ccfbe',calm:'#9bb8d0',focus:'#c792ea',nutrition:'#f2c57c',routine:'#8fd3c7'};
        const g = goals[i % goals.length];
        return base[g] || '#e6eef2';
      };

      for(let d=1; d<=30; d++){
        const div = document.createElement('div');
        div.className='day'+(d%7===0 ? ' active' : '');
        div.title = 'Day '+d;
        div.style.background = colorFor(d-1);
        div.textContent = d%7===0 ? '★' : '';
        track.appendChild(div);
      }

      // Milestones
      const ms = el('milestones'); ms.innerHTML='';
      const marks = [7,14,21,30];
      marks.forEach(m=>{
        const box = document.createElement('div');
        const suggested = suggestForDay(m,goals);
        box.innerHTML = '<strong>Day '+m+'</strong><div class="muted" style="margin-top:6px;font-size:13px">'+suggested+'</div>';
        ms.appendChild(box);
      });

      // smooth auto-scroll to first active
      setTimeout(()=>{ const active = track.querySelector('.active'); if(active) active.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',inline:'center'}); },200);
    }

    function suggestForDay(day,goals){
      // map day to short habit suggestion
      const pick = goals[(Math.floor(day/5)-1 + goals.length) % goals.length];
      const hints = {
        sleep: 'Stick to a 30-minute wind-down: dim lights, one page reading, no screens.',
        movement: 'A 12-minute gentle full-body routine, morning or evening.',
        calm: 'Three breath cycles: inhale 4, hold 4, exhale 6 — do this twice daily.',
        focus: 'Choose one task and protect 25 minutes for it — no multitasking.',
        nutrition: 'Simplify one meal: protein + veg + an easy prep trick.',
        routine: 'Anchor to an existing habit: after your morning coffee, add one short ritual.'
      };
      return hints[pick] || 'Small, repeatable action that supports your chosen focus.';
    }

    // Proof gallery: rotating testimonials
    const TESTIMONIALS = [
      {quote:'I swapped one small habit and the rest of my week started to fit.', who:'Jamie, teacher'},
      {quote:'A gentle plan that actually lasted — clearer mornings and steadier focus.', who:'Marta, product lead'},
      {quote:'Practical, warm, and patient coaching. I finally kept a daily habit.', who:'Riley, entrepreneur'}
    ];
    let tIndex = 0;
    const quoteEl = el('quote');
    const authorEl = el('author');
    function rotateTestimonial(){
      tIndex = (tIndex+1) % TESTIMONIALS.length;
      const t = TESTIMONIALS[tIndex];
      // fade out/in
      quoteEl.style.opacity='0'; authorEl.style.opacity='0';
      setTimeout(()=>{ quoteEl.textContent = '"'+t.quote+'"'; authorEl.textContent = '— '+t.who; quoteEl.style.opacity='1'; authorEl.style.opacity='1'; },300);
    }
    setInterval(rotateTestimonial, 4200);

    // Simple contact handling (local demo)
    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = el('name').value.trim();
      const email = el('email').value.trim();
      if(!name || !email){ alert('Please add your name and email.'); return; }
      alert('Thanks '+name+' — your message was noted. We will follow up at '+email+'.');
      this.reset();
      el('pathmap').style.display='none';
    });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Chunk 4 — contact.html + README

This bundle contains two files for the wellness coach site variant (layoutFamily=clinic_modern, voiceFamily=warm_storyteller). Files included in this chunk:

- contact.html — The contact + interactive mapping page.
- README.md — This description and usage notes.

Features implemented in contact.html
- Contact form with local demo submission (no server required).
- Progress meter: select up to 3 goals; click "Map My 30 Days" to render a 30-day path map. The map creates a 30-node visual, highlights weekly milestones (days 7,14,21,30) and offers small habit suggestions tied to chosen goals.
- Proof gallery: rotating testimonials (client quotes) and a set of credibility badges. Badges reveal details via tooltips on hover.
- Local-only JS and CSS (no external dependencies, no CDNs).
- Uses placeholders for site values: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.

Testing instructions
1. Open contact.html in a modern browser.
2. Select up to three goals and click "Map My 30 Days" to view the generated path map and milestones.
3. Watch the testimonials rotate every ~4.2 seconds. Hover badges to see tooltips.
4. Submit the contact form (local alert) to test form handling.

Integration notes
- This chunk assumes other site pages (index.html, about.html, programs.html, services.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html) exist and are linked via the navigation.
- Visual pattern file reference: assets/img/pattern.svg is referenced by the overall design but not included in this chunk. Add a unique SVG in that path in another chunk to complete the visual language.

Accessibility
- The path track uses aria-label and the code attempts to keep interactions keyboard-friendly. Tooltips are visible on hover; for full keyboard accessibility, add focus handlers in a later pass.

Style and copy
- Copy uses a warm storyteller tone and new metaphors ("30-day path", "small steady changes"). Phrasing and CTA use the provided placeholders.

Notes for builders
- All assets are local. If bundling, ensure other pages and assets are placed at the same relative paths.
- This file purposefully avoids external fonts and images; styling relies on system fonts and CSS.

If you need the matching assets (SVG pattern) or the remaining pages in this variant, request the next chunk."}
BUNDLE_END
